  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "They stimulated tourism and incited engineers to develop visionary ideas. For example, the \"Transhelvetian Canal\" should make the Swiss waterways navigable even across the Alps and connect them with the sea.\n\nOr let us recall Max Frisch’s deep love of the sea, and its influence on his works. Explore the Swiss yearning for the sea in the new Explora story.\n\nExplora is ETH Library’s multimedia storytelling platform."
    }
